                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-3__amdact-1__item-11__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p>; or (c)	the assessable income of the beneficiary of the year of income includes an amount of:</p>
                </content>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-3__amdact-1__item-11__qstr-1__para-i">
                  <num>i</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>	(i)	social security pension or education entry payment (within the meaning of the <i>Social Security Act 1991</i>); or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-3__amdact-1__item-11__qstr-1__para-ii">
                  <num>ii</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>	(ii)	service pension, carer service pension, income support supplement or Defence Force Income Support Allowance (within the meaning of the <i>Veterans’ Entitlements Act 1986</i>) or a DFISA-like payment mentioned in <ref href="#dvs-4">Division 4</ref> of <ref href="#part-VIIAB">Part VIIAB</ref> of that Act;</p>
                  </content>
                  <content>
                    <p>and, on at least one day during the year of income, the beneficiary is not in gaol.</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-3__amdact-1__item-12">
              <num>12</num>
              <heading>Section 160AAA (heading)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the heading, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-3__amdact-1__item-12__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <section eId="schedule-3__amdact-1__item-12__qstr-1__sec-160AAA">
